name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-preassessment-q14_2026'

question 'A news website plays a moving headline marquee across the top of the page. Some users say it\'s eye-catching; others find it distracting and hard to read. What does this scenario most directly illustrate?'

wrong 'Marquees are always bad design.'
wrong 'Users should not visit websites with animation.'
right 'Design choices involve trade-offs — what helps one user can frustrate another, so interactive features need to be evaluated for accessibility.'
wrong 'JavaScript animations are slow on most devices.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

